  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release. [LdbEntity] classes whose schema, row reads and writes a source generator writes at compile time (shipped inside this package; build errors LDB1001 to LDB1009), keys of one property or composite keys of several, with foreign keys and links over every part, a unit of work (LdbContext) with an identity map, change tracking by value, links between entities saved in one transaction, optimistic checks through [ConcurrencyCheck], and EnsureTableAsync for a table with its seed entities; no reflection over properties, Native AOT safe.",
